[{"title":"观华光长老仲仁墨梅","author":"邹浩","text":"我从梅花海里来，惊此两枝堂上开。\n不由天降非地出，道人作么生栽培。\n无缝塔子通一线，放光照醒陈根荄。\n玉蟾银汉雨初霁，半启琼室通瑶台。\n香云漠漠护颜色，世眼欲睹诚难哉。\n不如取酒共春醉，一杯一杯复一杯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56743,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和范信中同游花药有作","author":"邹浩","text":"花药山去来，难遇此天日。\n深衣书眼青，摩衲禅眼碧。\n雁峰相与高，可以同我适。\n浮云当面开，千里见丛荜。\n况紫盖祝融，插天日未夕。\n正尔无能名，僧来乞题石。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56744,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湘阴邓氏翠微洞","author":"邹浩","text":"卧云云无心，听松松有韵。\n快哉耳目中，吾今亦同分。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56745,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送成老赴西安","author":"邹浩","text":"先生出逢尧舜时，自当勋业追皋夔。\n胸中廊庙乃州县，雪霜次骨西安驰。\n旁观往往屡兴叹，色初不变心希夷。\n但云将圣世所大，乘田委吏皆尝为。\n道通为一无不可，等君事耳何高卑。\n高斋高居万物表，清献清风天下师。\n此心妙与此公契，莫或遑处今其谁。\n民歌仁恩到天耳，天须默荐君王知。\n坐令四海归一握，阴阳变化随设施。\n行即验矣姑且置，聊引花前金屈卮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56746,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶书","author":"邹浩","text":"朝读一卷经，暮读一卷书。\n一卷复一卷，三藏与五车。\n儒释本不异，昧者自亲疏。\n昧者不足道，明者当何如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56747,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送陈公晦","author":"邹浩","text":"寂不闻凤鸣，双耳聋已久。\n聿来丹山子，一旦惊户牖。\n旧听歘我还，喜气薄牛斗。\n箫韶方九成，飞勿众禽后。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56748,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吴公蔚将还滁阳出所集述德堂诗作此送之","author":"邹浩","text":"述德高堂在何许，述德高人欣可睹。\n彭州梦破知几年，遗爱远追曾大父。\n至今民数旧邦君，每及吴公歌且舞。\n述而行之德莫穷，定可周流浃天宇。\n谁令千里便归休，炯炯此心元自古。\n四百六十五甲子，貌若岩松傲风雨。\n胸中何啻法界宽，普集尘沙诸佛祖。\n一如一切悉皆如，迥脱拘挛不踰矩。\n从横肉眼讵能窥，但见鼻间常栩栩。\n只应高与老人星，长现升平瑞明主。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56749,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏张公奭庐墓有芝三本","author":"邹浩","text":"此芝初无根，生自孝诚里。\n孝哉本于诚，非缘利心起。\n无芝非所怍，有芝非所喜。\n不期芝有无，秀出乃如此。\n养志勤色难，送终极哀毁。\n既葬不忍归，结庐独留止。\n孺慕秋复春，泪接九泉水。\n比邻或未知，天已知之矣。\n因芝示邦人，邦人争赞美。\n会逢当路贤，荐此八行始。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56750,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书公孙卷末","author":"邹浩","text":"韩范天下贤，褒贬不妄出。\n舌端有春秋，所与惟其实。\n一举十五丧，富贵所难必。\n公孙贱且贫，兹事乃能毕。\n心追古人高，迹付今人述。\n二老首形容，昭劝无终日。\n伊予特后闻，叹恨颇自失。\n东望天山平，风松正萧瑟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56751,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"代书寄清老","author":"邹浩","text":"从来游戏常三昧，出语纵横无忌讳。\n老聃全与释迦同，人畏犹云亦当畏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56752,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题双芝轩","author":"邹浩","text":"难弟难兄强氏子，太学声名耸多士。\n同时流辈久公卿，犹傍短檠业文史。\n今年鉴拔贡辟廱，伯仲皆升从此起。\n集英春晓拱天临，龙头妙绝人间喜。\n鸾台凤阁便腾骞，况乃吾乡有前比。\n向来胸中宇宙宽，包尽华夷无复委。\n发为勋业助尧仁，肯令元凯常专美。\n倘如不信视双芝，端不虚生漫黄紫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56753,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和路主簿思雨","author":"邹浩","text":"造物初无欠与馀，盈虚消息自洪垆。\n晴空已见云如火，秋穫难期米似珠。\n剧邑君宜形远虑，泮宫我亦念群枯。\n若为惊起苍龙睡，赖有新诗胜大雩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56754,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"独坐偶书","author":"邹浩","text":"梧桐沐雨响玲珑，帘幕阴阴飏晚风。\n讲诵乍闻人语息，满床书史兴何穷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56755,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄濠州陶户曹","author":"邹浩","text":"台枕长淮耸半空，登临应得古人风。\n水天上下碧无际，莫获观鱼与子同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56756,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"勉毕元明","author":"邹浩","text":"男儿数偶奇，不必苦嗟咨。\n颜子犹箪食，庄生亦布衣。\n百年容易老，万卷卒难窥。\n致力宜为者，腾骧自有时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56757,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢罗朝奉惠柏栽","author":"邹浩","text":"惠我柏虽小，观君意实深。\n欲令儒服者，同此岁寒心。\n月映庭雕玉，风来韵响金。\n公车已驰节，不及待清阴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56758,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和钱签判赠胡都曹","author":"邹浩","text":"公馀来访习家池，楚楚王孙桂一枝。\n九十春光未过半，倒罍尤喜有前期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56759,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和路主簿喜罢役法并酬范奉议见寄","author":"邹浩","text":"因革纷然岂用情，由来消息与时行。\n奏封直指财并力，造法当期实应名。\n可使华夷渐润泽，不烦衡石自均平。\n将明况是忧民者，即见熙熙百室盈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56760,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酬黄秀才见寄","author":"邹浩","text":"自期谋道不谋身，不逐轻狂戏此春。\n读史穷经求在我，攀龙附凤彼何人。\n一言逢主未如志，百结成衣肯叹贫。\n早晚病除堪属思，新诗莫厌起予频。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56761,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶书","author":"邹浩","text":"底事爰丝不自高，倾心剧孟久游遨。\n元来缓急叩门处，徇义忘躯胜我曹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56762,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和郡主簿绝句九绝 其一","author":"邹浩","text":"管鲍当年志，风霜固自如。\n信衰缘嗜欲，岂在数行书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56763,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和郡主簿绝句九绝 其二","author":"邹浩","text":"俗论长纷若，微言仅梦如。\n逢君挥玉麈，胜读十年书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56764,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和郡主簿绝句九绝 其三","author":"邹浩","text":"肘后虚金印，梅仙职偶如。\n升高元自下，功业异时书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56765,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和郡主簿绝句九绝 其四","author":"邹浩","text":"塞北亢喉地，并门子所如。\n六花无处用，却縠自诗书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56766,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和郡主簿绝句九绝 其五","author":"邹浩","text":"能诗唐太白，善赋汉相如。\n元帅真文举，应先荐祢书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56767,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和郡主簿绝句九绝 其六","author":"邹浩","text":"取友能无怍，初终贵一如。\n陈张遗辙在，试展马迁书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56768,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和郡主簿绝句九绝 其七","author":"邹浩","text":"咳唾成珠玉，吾侪孰子如。\n更勤潘氏学，岂愧乐尚书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56769,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和郡主簿绝句九绝 其八","author":"邹浩","text":"提履归何处，观花笑自如。\n期君求向上，糟粕古人书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56770,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和郡主簿绝句九绝 其九","author":"邹浩","text":"春风暗杨柳，相见意何如。\n虽愧江淹笔，狂言为子书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56771,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送诗卷还参寥","author":"邹浩","text":"盈轴新诗字字清，弥天元不愧声名。\n茂陵消渴无医处，赖有醍醐得细倾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56772,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和路子高微雨中至山光寺","author":"邹浩","text":"野阔天低四望赊，霏微膏雨兆休嘉。\n早钟郁郁穿云断，官柳垂垂夹道斜。\n邂逅庭前方指柏，逡巡木末已栖鸦。\n杨朱易服归来处，荷笠收车几万家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56773,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送监作院潘供备 其一","author":"邹浩","text":"盟府功臣奕世孙，低回筦库尚随群。\n干戈分职名虽武，诗酒忘怀格自文。\n倾盖二年嗟往事，赢粮一日指行云。\n江梅欺雪南枝发，如綍新除定此闻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56774,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送监作院潘供备 其二","author":"邹浩","text":"飘飘雅致孰如君，旋辟西轩置酒樽。\n振木岂惟闻白雪，断缨仍许醉黄昏。\n长亭风顺已言别，小圃春回空自繁。\n惆怅潜斋不知处，何年携手却重论。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56775,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"简王正父觅酒","author":"邹浩","text":"瓮面蛆浮玉，槽头水滴珠。\n未能如茂世，聊与义城俱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56776,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄周彦廉","author":"邹浩","text":"楚水不风鱼逝远，霜天初月雁飞高。\n履穿袍敝浑无暇，目断心驰祗自劳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56777,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和刘知录见寄并简阳先生","author":"邹浩","text":"刘郎爽气晓霜晴，阳子高怀宝鉴明。\n虽幸竹林容入会，每惭布鼓独无声。\n一杯葵藿真佳趣，五鼎牛羊谩宰生。\n廊庙他年调燮手，不妨潜室且和羹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56778,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和阳先生见赠","author":"邹浩","text":"万卷藏书肯自閒，沉涵圣道欲晞颜。\n片心既与人寰远，逸驾宁容俗士攀。\n嗟我曳裾胶扰处，荷君置榻寂寥间。\n藜羹玉麈清何限，每到斜阳不忍还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56779,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"求刘知录澄泥香炉","author":"邹浩","text":"千卷新书三叠琴，青灯炯炯夜沉沉。\n野人此外无馀好，只欠澄泥一炷深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56780,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大雨中接宪使因成小诗呈阳先生","author":"邹浩","text":"霜风折木雨如倾，敛板泥中厮役并。\n遥想先生鼓琴罢，观书正傍短灯檠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56781,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵盛长官觅酒","author":"邹浩","text":"九万鹏程戢怒飞，驱愁却叹酒无威。\n頖宫官冷非文举，一斗何能醉十围。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56782,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵胡秀才遗桃花","author":"邹浩","text":"灼灼桃源数朵红，青禽传到荜门中。\n傍人只喜窥春色，达士元来寄祖风。\n谩说几经千岁赏，会须一笑万缘空。\n沉香散处圆蒲稳，花自蕃鲜体自同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56783,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵俞秀老建隆道中","author":"邹浩","text":"道人不独是诗豪，曾把沧溟注一毛。\n破晓联镳访孤寂，致身如在太山高。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56784,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵慕公实","author":"邹浩","text":"从来文史足三冬，何事明时作退翁。\n刺口岂能论扰扰，冥心直欲似空空。\n半轩苍莽雨初霁，一钓清泠月正胧。\n好把晨昏付香火，个中真乐更无穷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56785,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵钱?雪中","author":"邹浩","text":"六出飞琼玖，云愁正腊天。\n寒声生密竹，爽气彻纯绵。\n故苑风初静，重楼月向圆。\n何当酬此景，蘸甲引金船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56786,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵王贤良赠阳先生 其一","author":"邹浩","text":"脩涂几阅岁终穷，鹤唳猿啼蕙帐空。\n杖屦何当归旧隐，静看五柳飏春风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56787,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵王贤良赠阳先生 其二","author":"邹浩","text":"嚣嚣所乐本非穷，曾向真乘悟色空。\n闻说近添方外友，清谈应得晋人风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56788,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"二月十五日朝拜建隆桥上偶作","author":"邹浩","text":"单衣迎犯晓风清，斗柄回南月尚明。\n柳密行人看不见，轮蹄相属但闻声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56789,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清明日游大明道中","author":"邹浩","text":"春风荡漾遍天涯，纵步郊原事事嘉。\n不许游人同所得，竹林深处试龙茶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56790,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和通判王定国承议游竹西 其一","author":"邹浩","text":"流年忽忽又残春，策杖郊原肯厌频。\n往古来今何足校，閒花幽草自争新。\n旋开酒蚁成高会，共解名缰作逸民。\n随处怡然真有味，不须千里忆吴莼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56791,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和通判王定国承议游竹西 其二","author":"邹浩","text":"一霎狂飙破晓阴，春光极目几千寻。\n会须胜事追莲社，更约幽人访竹林。\n渺渺平田涵白水，萧萧苍桧聒清音。\n郑虔才大犹遭骂，重愧持杯许脱簪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56792,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送胡适道秀才东归","author":"邹浩","text":"十年星散忽相逢，寂寞芜城古頖宫。\n一炷澄泥窥祖要，三卮浮蚁对春丛。\n牢刍岂解留天骥，云路还闻逐塞鸿。\n莲社故人如见问，为言涉世百无功。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56793,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵蔡宽夫解元暮春见怀 其一","author":"邹浩","text":"九十青阳安在哉，临风搔首谩迟回。\n春于我辈非无意，诗必先成为有才。\n拖架酴醾香破麝，翻阶芍药大逾杯。\n病除更约归愚子，浮蚁犹堪席地开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56794,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵蔡宽夫解元暮春见怀 其二","author":"邹浩","text":"惊红簌簌点苍苔，春去黄鹂唤不回。\n九藏脉参知我病，千人笔扫见君才。\n会须磥砢挥谈麈，方悟蜿蜒落酒杯。\n命驾相应怜叔夜，笑颜一月几能开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56795,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又倒用前韵","author":"邹浩","text":"休论花草与楼台，借得江南叠嶂开。\n纵使春归无觅处，何妨人乐自持杯。\n棋如孙武推多算，诗似颜渊已竭才。\n早晚竹林修故事，更看君笔灿昭回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56796,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送及之贤良游钱塘","author":"邹浩","text":"屏迹人间二十年，下帷搰搰究陈编。\n新书曾入老商盼，高弟谁如颜子贤。\n策杖青山元有约，挥金红药故无缘。\n岂宜便隐双溪去，优诏行闻坠日边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56797,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送俞秀老归维扬","author":"邹浩","text":"踏雪驱驱原宪履，御风猎猎老莱衣。\n情投岂比钟山出，兴尽远同剡水归。\n炀帝池边松荫远，维摩室内烛光微。\n携筇促席相羊处，应记当年接下机。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56798,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪中呈秀老原道","author":"邹浩","text":"引舟西上正隆冬，千里隋堤雪翳空。\n恰似常年三月尾，柳花凌乱逐东风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56799,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏孙扬休","author":"邹浩","text":"耿耿僧坊寄日边，晚移穷巷避諠阗。\n羹藜不饱同攻苦，秣马言归独处先。\n木叶已随风力远，霜轮行作璧形圆。\n衣冠返敝文昌路，何似高堂坦腹眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56800,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"简李子温推官","author":"邹浩","text":"太冲当日号无兄，苗裔于今更绝伦。\n力究本原书簏富，唾成珠玉锦囊新。\n龙门久欲攀高躅，鼎角方欣觇后尘。\n借问竹溪馀地否，狂吟聊伴谪仙人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56801,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄周廉彦","author":"邹浩","text":"不见冰清几岁周，乘风举翮恨无由。\n濒江松竹三秋后，隐几情怀万事休。\n险阻艰难空蚁斗，东西南北正萍浮。\n与君相好如兄弟，莫惜微言为置邮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56802,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"风起有感","author":"邹浩","text":"秋来郁郁但炎蒸，一夜狂飙骇四邻。\n断送冥鸿尤得势，留连残暑更无因。\n镜中鬓发虽非故，窗下灯檠渐可亲。\n勿似安仁儿女态，由看节物重悲辛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56803,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵崔浚明见赠","author":"邹浩","text":"谁为冥行作指南，青灯黄卷久间关。\n逢君岂测陂千顷，许我时窥豹一斑。\n骥足拘挛虽未展，龙鳞腾踏会须攀。\n如何暗把隋珠掷，欲报殷勤只强颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56804,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"将至南京简应介中 其一","author":"邹浩","text":"得之平陆我登车，不见群优孟子诛。\n只恐鼻端无好质，归时依旧腹空虚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56805,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"将至南京简应介中 其二","author":"邹浩","text":"几日风尘困马蹄，忽瞻孤塔献云霓。\n双眸已似清江洗，况入亭城见角犀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56806,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"将至南京简应介中 其三","author":"邹浩","text":"先生不得醉红裙，何以留连逆旅人。\n故苑池台老秋色，頖宫讲罢走车轮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56807,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"将至南京简应介中 其四","author":"邹浩","text":"直谅多闻许我亲，迷途从此遂知津。\n社中忽怪尔来进，曾向睢阳见异人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56808,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九月朔夜闻雨","author":"邹浩","text":"尘濛蛛网暗东斋，设榻君能待我来。\n昨夜梧桐有消息，会须急上宋王台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56809,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送曹巨源之南都","author":"邹浩","text":"高堂且置琴中操，骏马初驰陌上尘。\n无限清风与明月，一时分付属閒人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":56810,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]